      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's a bit too short though. can you flesh it out more? specifically, i want a section that defines what is actually considered \"incompatible\" with an inclusive environment. like, should there be specific rules about political discussions on internal Slack channels or wearing certain symbols/clothing to work? how do we define the line between \"personal expression\" and \"disrupting the culture\"?",
